Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:38:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 58/58] DEBUG: MTROPOLIS: Add autoplay driver and tracing (not
 for upstream)

Local reverse-engineering tools, not meant to be submitted:

- An input driver enabled by the MTROPOLIS_AUTOPLAY environment
  variable, which follows a command file (wait, click, type, key,
  shot, waitscene, goto, elements, hide/show, scenes, quit). It is
  used to skip the intro and to test scenes without manual play.
- At debug level 9, dumps of Miniscript programs (MSDUMP, read by
  tools/msdecompile.py), messenger and behavior settings (MODINFO),
  scene trees (TREE) and author messages as they are sent (MSG).

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
